        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CK-3250, Melon Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Smooth Melon Cabinet Knob has just enough design details to bring your eye to it once it is installed on a kitchen cabinet, in the bathroom, or on a closet, but it does not have too much going on that it is overwhelming. It is available in 7 finishes. This melon knob made by RK International has a 1-1/4 inch diameter. Features an easy, screw-on installation.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/melon-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-3249\"><b>Melon Cabinet Knob With Button Center</b></a> and \r\n<a href=\"/products/half-melon-cup-pull-rk-international-cf-5251\"><b>Half Melon Cup Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CK-3250 Simple Melon Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
